OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer in critical care unit gets
OL,4,Asurprise visit from calves
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Lancashire dairy farmer, who has been
OL,7,Fcritically ill in hospital for six
OL,8,Fweeks, has been reunited with his
OL,9,Fbeloved calves in a surprise visit
OL,10,Forganised by staff.
OL,12,FThe patient, who is being treated at
OL,13,FRoyal Blackburn Teaching Hospital, was
OL,14,Ftaken outside in a wheelchair to meet
OL,15,Fthe Hereford and Shorthorn calves where
OL,16,Fthey were waiting for him in a pen.
OL,18,FHe even got the chance to meet a calf
OL,19,Fwhich had been born on the day he was
OL,20,Fadmitted to hospital.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
